{"1394470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Umami Grove", "steam_appid": 1394470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/d96ce3f872e5263544d285295aaa1f74.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/d96ce3f872e5263544d285295aaa1f74.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/7cba13eefbc5d00d22640fd3db72eb25.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/7cba13eefbc5d00d22640fd3db72eb25.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/7cba13eefbc5d00d22640fd3db72eb25.mp4?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Culinary Journey Begins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a lush, open world, <strong>Umami Grove</strong> invites players into a comfy cooking adventure that utilizes a <strong>powerful locomotion</strong> and <strong>interaction system</strong>. Complete tasks for a <strong>quirky cast of NPCs</strong> while you <strong>forage for ingredients</strong> in a visually rich, atmospheric world themed after <strong>seasons</strong>. You’ll face peril and hone your cooking for the greatest prize of all: Gold! In the shape of acorns. And possibly enchanted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/bd6260dfdaefbe9e2b5b84c135582e87.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/bd6260dfdaefbe9e2b5b84c135582e87.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/bd6260dfdaefbe9e2b5b84c135582e87.mp4?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel a gorgeous world, meet adorable creatures, and cook them! (Or for them, usually.) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges using your hands and the surrounding environment! Throwing a fish at something probably won’t solve a problem, but you won’t know until you try. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That tree can be climbed and its apples picked, the mushroom on the table can be dynamically cut! Use a robust physics engine and your own hands to get the full cooking experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wide cast of characters that you can help in various ways! Help them go back to bed, cook a meal for them, or just please stop accidentally breaking their stuff! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ponder what exactly is the deal with these acorns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/9b77aa29ae94a1a4fc3a5ba69d834fa8.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/9b77aa29ae94a1a4fc3a5ba69d834fa8.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/9b77aa29ae94a1a4fc3a5ba69d834fa8.mp4?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/d96ce3f872e5263544d285295aaa1f74.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/d96ce3f872e5263544d285295aaa1f74.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/7cba13eefbc5d00d22640fd3db72eb25.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/7cba13eefbc5d00d22640fd3db72eb25.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/7cba13eefbc5d00d22640fd3db72eb25.mp4?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Culinary Journey Begins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a lush, open world, <strong>Umami Grove</strong> invites players into a comfy cooking adventure that utilizes a <strong>powerful locomotion</strong> and <strong>interaction system</strong>. Complete tasks for a <strong>quirky cast of NPCs</strong> while you <strong>forage for ingredients</strong> in a visually rich, atmospheric world themed after <strong>seasons</strong>. You’ll face peril and hone your cooking for the greatest prize of all: Gold! In the shape of acorns. And possibly enchanted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/bd6260dfdaefbe9e2b5b84c135582e87.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/bd6260dfdaefbe9e2b5b84c135582e87.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/bd6260dfdaefbe9e2b5b84c135582e87.mp4?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel a gorgeous world, meet adorable creatures, and cook them! (Or for them, usually.) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges using your hands and the surrounding environment! Throwing a fish at something probably won’t solve a problem, but you won’t know until you try. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That tree can be climbed and its apples picked, the mushroom on the table can be dynamically cut! Use a robust physics engine and your own hands to get the full cooking experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wide cast of characters that you can help in various ways! Help them go back to bed, cook a meal for them, or just please stop accidentally breaking their stuff! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ponder what exactly is the deal with these acorns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/9b77aa29ae94a1a4fc3a5ba69d834fa8.poster.avif?t=1772601879\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/9b77aa29ae94a1a4fc3a5ba69d834fa8.webm?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/extras/9b77aa29ae94a1a4fc3a5ba69d834fa8.mp4?t=1772601879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A deliciously interactive VR journey awaits! Jump, climb, duck, and swing through vibrant worlds on a quest to help cute characters gather luscious ingredients and create mouthwatering dishes—hands-on!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/header.jpg?t=1772601879", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772601879", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772601879", "website": "https://umamigrove.dangenentertainment.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1, Windows 8.1 or later, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060, AMD Radeon RX 480 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "DANGEN ENTERTAINMENT is a trademark of Dangen Entertainment. <br />\r\nCopyright © 2025 Dangen Entertainment. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Pomshine Games"], "publishers": ["DANGEN Entertainment"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1999, "final": 1999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$19.99"}, "packages": [489282], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "titl